{"unit_id":"kobenfang__BigSeedSkill#feature-1","repo":"kobenfang/BigSeedSkill","commit":"9f67417fb0d82935f74fa2bc2499a84059958aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BigSeed 的功能「记录闪念」：把文本内容保存为种子记录，并附时间、类型、情绪、标签和可选图片路径。通过 add 命令触发，记录写入 workspace 的 JSON 数据文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/bigseed.py:61-81"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__BigSeedSkill#feature-2","repo":"kobenfang/BigSeedSkill","commit":"9f67417fb0d82935f74fa2bc2499a84059958aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BigSeed 的功能「筛选回看」：按日期范围、类型或情绪过滤已有种子，并输出匹配记录及其标签。通过 query 命令触发，适合查找过去记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/bigseed.py:83-109"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__BigSeedSkill#feature-3","repo":"kobenfang/BigSeedSkill","commit":"9f67417fb0d82935f74fa2bc2499a84059958aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BigSeed 的功能「汇总统计」：统计选定日期范围内记录的数量、类型分布、情绪分布和常见标签。通过 stats 命令触发，结果打印在终端。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/bigseed.py:152-194"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__BigSeedSkill#feature-4","repo":"kobenfang/BigSeedSkill","commit":"9f67417fb0d82935f74fa2bc2499a84059958aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BigSeed 的功能「准备故事素材」：按日期和数量限制筛选种子，并连同画像数据输出 JSON，供模型据此创作故事或报告。通过 seeds-for-story 命令触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/bigseed.py:120-150"]}
{"unit_id":"kobenfang__BigSeedSkill#caveat-1","repo":"kobenfang/BigSeedSkill","commit":"9f67417fb0d82935f74fa2bc2499a84059958aab","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"BigSeed 使用前须知：脚本会在 workspace 的 memory/bigseed-data 下创建和读写种子、画像及故事 JSON 文件；已读脚本未见外部服务调用。（见 scripts/bigseed.py:25-42）","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/bigseed.py:25-42"]}
